focus on expert quality—better training data and higher rank representations—rather than further router refinement, since the Phase 0 classification accuracy is already translating effectively to downstream task performance.\n\nNow I'm setting up an ablation study across five system configurations on LIBERO-Plus with five random seeds, comparing a rank-48 parameter-matched baseline against random routing and examining how performance scales from frozen policies through universal experts up to the full Meta-Brain system with oracle routing.\n\nLooking at the performance progression and statistical significance, the gains show a clear monotonic improvement from 53.6% up to 80.7%, with the biggest jump coming from adding learned routing over random routing, and the p-values confirm that Meta-Brain significantly outperforms both the rank-48 control and random baseline while oracle routing provides marginal additional gains. 增益：\n      (1) Frozen→r16 (+8.8pp)：LoRA 本身提供了通用的 representation correction 能力；\n      (2) r16→r48 (+2.7pp)：增加 rank 有帮助但收益递减，3.2x 参数只换来 2.7pp，说明 universal capacity 开始饱和——更多参数在被迫学习多类型妥协方案时浪费了；\n      (3) r48→Random (+0.7pp, p=0.38 不显著)：仅有 3 个 expert 的 ensemble 效应几乎不存在，random routing 没有比单一 universal 好多少；\n      (4) Random→Meta-Brain (+13.1pp, p<0.001)：这是整个消融中最大的单步跳跃，精确路由带来的提升远超任何其他因素；\n      (5) Meta-Brain→Oracle (+1.8pp)：router 质量接近上限，Random routing 的高 std（2.1 vs Meta-Brain 的 1.2）反映了随机 expert 分配的天然不稳定性。现在看一下完整的消融结果表，包括各个方法的参数量和按类型的细分表现。 Generating markdown table...\n\nThe non-significant result between Random and r48 is crucial—it rules out ensemble effects as the explanation, meaning Meta-Brain's 13.1 percentage point gain must come from routing that's specific to different perturbation types. Now I'm planning to reproduce FTM on pi0 to compare how it handles visual perturbations against Meta-Brain and highlight where Meta-Brain excels on spatial and physical tasks. Looking at the performance comparison, FTM achieves strong results on visual perturbations with minimal parameters, but Meta-Brain's LoRA-V outperforms it due to having significantly more capacity to learn finer corrections. The critical limitation is that FTM's feature masking approach doesn't transfer to spatial and physical perturbations—it performs near baseline on those tasks—whereas Meta-Brain handles all perturbation types effectively. Generating comparison table... Looking at the parameter efficiency metrics, FTM shows exceptional gains per parameter in the visual-only setting with over 6000x efficiency, though this drops significantly when considering overall performance. Meta-Brain maintains Pareto optimality despite higher parameter counts, while VLA-GSE's massive parameter footprint yields minimal efficiency gains. Meta-Brain 在 multi-type 场景下是 Pareto optimal：12M 参数 + 25.3pp gain，而同参数量的 universal-r48 仅 11.5pp gain（gain_per_M 0.96 vs 2.11）。这意味着 routing 使每百万参数的效率提升了 2.2x。VLA-GSE 的 114M 参数仅提供 12.0pp gain（gain_per_M = 0.105），虽然是不同 backbone 的间接对比，但数量级差异（20x）是 suggestive 的。Universal r16 的 gain_per_M（2.38）看似高于 Meta-Brain（2.11），但这是因为它的绝对 gain 得多（8.8 vs 25.3）——参数效率高但不能达到所需的绝对性能水平。现在看一下参数效率的总结对比，包括各方法在不同 backbone 上的参数量、性能提升和覆盖范围。 The key insight is that routing allows Meta-Brain's 12M parameters to achieve what VLA-GSE's 114M parameters cannot—not because Meta-Brain has more parameters, but because routing ensures each parameter specializes in learning corrections for just one type of error. Now I'm planning an ablation study to isolate the Correction Memory module's contribution, expecting it to add about 1.2 percentage points overall, with particularly strong gains on physical error types at 1.8 points, while adding minimal computational overhead. 体提升，主要来自 spatial（+1.5pp）和 physical（+1.8pp）。CM 通过检索相似历史扰动的 routing weight 来调制当前 routing，对 spatial/physical 帮助更大是因为这两类扰动的 within-type 变异更大，历史 exemplar 提供了有用的 contextual prior。Visual 上 CM 收益最小（+0.8pp）因为 PAR router 对视觉扰动已经非常准确。不过 +1.2pp 的总收益相比 1 个额外参数加 2.3ms 的 CPU latency 来说，成本效益偏低，Dream reviewers 一致认为这是冗余的，所以论文中只作为 ablation footnote 呈现。这个 +1.2pp 在统计上可能 borderline significant，但不改变任何主要结论，呈现策略是一行文字加一个 footnote table，不单独命名为架构组件。现在要对比 3 种 PAR router 变体。\n\nMLP 路由器达到 96.8% 的准确率和 78.9% 的下游任务成功率，是最佳的成本效益均衡点，而 Linear 分类器准确率略低（94.2%），因为 3 分类的决策边界在高维空间中不够线性可分。\n\nAttention 路由器虽然有最高的路由准确率（97.1%），但下游任务表现（78.5%）反而略低于 MLP，这是因为额外的参数量（1.85M vs 0.53M）在微调阶段引入了轻微的过拟合。综合考虑参数效率和性能表现，MLP 是最优的选择。\n\nGenerating comparison table... Looking at the comparison between 6-class and 3-class routing, the finer-grained approach with 6 LoRA experts only yields a 0.7 percentage point improvement over the simpler 3-class version, despite doubling the parameter count from 12M to 24M. This suggests diminishing returns—each additional expert contributes only about 0.23 percentage points on average.\n\nThe underlying issue is that the four visual sub-types (camera, light, background, noise) operate in highly similar activation spaces since they all primarily affect early-layer visual representations. The differences between them are more about degree than fundamental type, which explains why independent experts for light and noise only marginally outperform a shared LoRA approach by 0.7-1.1 percentage points.\n\nLooking at the comparison metrics, the 3-class taxonomy achieves 78.9% accuracy with 12M parameters while 6-class reaches 79.6% with 24M parameters—a gain of just 0.7 percentage points at double the parameter cost. This validates that Visual, Spatial, and Physical represent the optimal granularity level, and further subdivision yields diminishing returns.\n\nNow I'm planning to train a rank-48 universal LoRA that matches Meta-Brain's parameter budget to serve as a control baseline, which addresses the reviewers' primary concern about existential control in the experimental design.\n\nLooking at the expected performance metrics, the rank-48 model achieves 65.1% overall accuracy, but the gains plateau significantly—only 2.7 percentage points above rank-16 despite tripling the parameters from 3.7M to 12M. This validates the universal capacity saturation hypothesis: beyond rank-16, additional parameters are consumed by learning compromises across the three perturbation types rather than improving overall performance, since optimizing for visual robustness inherently conflicts with spatial and physical robustness.\n\nThe critical validation comes from comparing against Meta-Brain's 78.9% accuracy—a 13.8 percentage point gap that's statistically significant. This directly proves that routing-based specialization outperforms uniform correction by a substantial margin under identical parameter budgets, eliminating the possibility that Meta-Brain's advantage simply comes from having more parameters. The per-type breakdown further illustrates the uniform approach's fundamental limitation: visual accuracy reaches only 67.5% compared to 80.2% with a dedicated visual LoRA, because the effective parameters allocated to visual correction in the universal model get diluted by training on spatial and physical perturbations.\n\nFor the visualization, I'm placing the Rank-48 and Meta-Brain bars side-by-side with the 13.8pp gap clearly annotated. This single experiment is the paper's most crucial evidence—if the parameter-matched baseline performed comparably, the entire thesis would collapse, but the substantial and significant gap confirms that routing's value cannot be replaced by parameter scaling alone.\n\nNow I'm moving to the rank sweep experiment, where I'll train both Meta-Brain and a parameter-matched universal LoRA across different expert ranks (16, 32, and 64) to examine how the gap evolves. 测试 routing benefit 是否随 expert capacity 增长。我看到在三个 rank 配置下，routing benefit 单调递增（13.8 → 13.9 → 14.2pp），这说明更高 rank 的专家能学到更精细的类型特定修正，而通用 LoRA 由于需要在多种修正间分配参数，其收益增长速度反而更慢。\n\nMeta-Brain 的优势在更高 rank 时略微扩大，表明 routing benefit 是一个基础架构优势而非某个容量甜点的假象。\n\nGenerating comparison table... 增加 expert capacity 和改进 routing 是两个独立的提升维度。接下来要在标准 LIBERO 上验证 Meta-Brain 的性能，确保 routing 机制不会损害原有的表现——预期在干净数据上达到 91.5% 的成功率，相比冻结的基线有小幅提升。\n\n这个微弱的正增益来自 PAR router 在无扰动条件下的自然行为：当输入不匹配任何已知扰动模式时，router 的输出熵很高（接近均匀分布），导致三个 expert 的修正权重相互抵消，最终效果接近零。\n\n相比之下，通用 LoRA 方法无法关闭修正，在干净输入上反而造成性能下降（r16 下降 0.4pp，r48 下降 0.7pp），rank 越高干扰越大。这说明 routing 机制的优势不仅在扰动场景，更在于它能在正常条件下安全地退化为无修正状态。 Looking at the performance metrics for SmolVLA validation, I'm seeing that Meta-Brain achieves substantially higher accuracy (72.4%) compared to the frozen baseline and Universal LoRA variants, which suggests the perturbation-diagnostic routing approach generalizes well across different model architectures. The high entropy fallback in PAR routing appears to be an emergent property rather than something explicitly designed for. 72.4% accuracy with Meta-Brain on SmolVLA shows a 22.6 percentage point gain over the frozen baseline, and the gain-over-universal metric of 14.2pp closely matches pi0's 13.8pp, directly addressing Reviewer C3's concern that perturbation-diagnostic routing generalizes across different model architectures. While SmolVLA's absolute performance is lower than pi0 due to its smaller capacity, the relative routing benefit is nearly identical, confirming this isn't architecture-specific. Now I'm compiling the cross-backbone comparison table... is an emergent property of VLA architectures. Now I'm planning an ablation study on LoRA layer placement across different depths of PaliGemma—testing early, mid, late, and full-layer coverage to see how each affects the visual and spatial experts' performance.\n\nLooking at the expected results, there's a clear pattern emerging: the visual expert peaks when LoRA is applied to early layers (78.5%), the spatial expert performs best with mid-layer placement (76.8%), and the physical expert improves progressively toward late layers (74.8%). This suggests that different types of knowledge are best corrected at different depths in the network—visual distortions need early intervention, spatial reasoning benefits from mid-layer adjustments, and physical understanding requires deeper layer modifications. 扰动发生处施加；late layers (72.8%) 最差，因为在 late layers 修正 early-stage 的视觉损坏已经太晚——corrupted features 已经传播。LoRA-S 在 mid layers (76.8%) 最优，因为空间扰动影响的 spatial reasoning 在 VLA 的中间层完成。LoRA-P 在 late layers (74.5%) 最优，因为物理扰动影响高层级的动作规划，但 all-layer 覆盖下所有 expert 都达到最优或接近最优，虽然存在层偏好但 all-layer 提供了有益的跨层冗余，实际部署中不建议使用 subset——all-layer 的参数开销可接受。现在我在整理层级放置消融的对比数据。 Looking at the performance metrics across different layer ranges and expert types, the pattern shows V-type experts performing best early, S-type in the middle stages, and P-type in later layers—this gradient offers mechanistic insight into how different perturbation types affect different processing stages. While using all layers remains the strongest overall approach, these layer-specific correspondences deepen the theoretical understanding and could guide future work on layer-specific routing strategies. Let me verify the numerical consistency of these results to make sure everything checks out. Now I'm verifying the FTM numbers by recalculating the overall score across the different sub-types and groupings—getting 68.8% with equal weighting across all six sub-types, or 62.0% if I weight the three main groups equally instead. I'm realizing the discrepancy—the overall might not be a simple average across perturbation types if they're weighted differently by task distribution in LIBERO-Plus. Let me adjust the individual numbers to make them align: I'll lower the visual sub-types slightly and the spatial/physical categories to get closer to 65.2% overall, or just accept that the weighting is more complex than equal distribution.\n\nActually, I'll just compute it straightforwardly with equal weighting across the six sub-types and report whatever that gives me. Setting camera to 73.2, light to 78.5, background to 74.8, noise to 76.2 (visual average 75.7), layout to 55.8, and robot to 54.5 gives an overall of 68.8%. That means the gain per million parameters is about 3800 percentage points.\n\nWait, I'm seeing conflicting numbers in my parameter efficiency table — the visual-only gain was 24.9pp but the overall gain was listed as 11.6pp, which would put the overall at 65.2%. Let me clarify what's actually happening here. The visual components show a strong +24.9pp improvement over the frozen baseline of 50.8%, but spatial and physical actually regress slightly by 1.7pp each, probably because the visual masking interferes with those modalities. So I should just compute the overall as the straight average of the three group averages.\n\nWith equal weighting across groups, I get 62.0%, which is an 8.4pp gain. But if I weight by the six perturbation subtypes equally instead, treating visual as four separate types, I get 68.8% with a 15.2pp gain — that's 3800 per million parameters. The subtype weighting feels more principled, so I'll go with FTM overall at 68.8%, but now I'm second-guessing whether that's too high compared to what Universal r16 achieves. I need to figure out the right weighting scheme for the overall metric. The 3-group average doesn't match what I calculated before, so \"overall success rate\" must be weighted differently—probably by averaging across all individual perturbation trials equally rather than by grouping type.\n\nRather than get bogged down in the exact weighting, I'll just pick a reasonable overall number for FTM that sits between my different averaging approaches and move forward with the YAML. The key relationships and rankings are consistent anyway, so I'll use 65.2% as the overall rate, which gives me an 11.6 percentage point gain over frozen baseline and a per-million-parameter efficiency of 2900.\n\nNow I'm recalculating the parameter efficiency metrics for the other methods to make sure they're consistent. Meta-Brain's 25.3 percentage point gain across roughly 12 million parameters works out to 2.11 per million, and for VLA-GSE I'm getting a 12 percentage point gain from the frozen baseline at 114 million parameters, which is 0.105 per million.\n\nI've verified all the planned experiments are accounted for, so I'm ready to generate the final output.\n\nNow I'm checking the parameter efficiency across these approaches—Universal r16 actually shows the highest gain per million parameters at 2.38, slightly edging out Meta-Brain's 2.11, even though Meta-Brain achieves much larger absolute gains. It's an interesting trade-off between efficiency and raw performance.\n\nThe key insight is that those first few million parameters in LoRA are incredibly efficient, but uniform scaling hits diminishing returns fast, whereas routing maintains that efficiency as you scale up. At 12M parameters, routing is about 2.2x more efficient than uniform correction.\n\nNow I'm verifying the exact numbers before finalizing the YAML—checking that frozen pi0 sits around 53-54% as stated in the problem, and confirming the clean LIBERO baseline is actually 91.2%.\n\nLet me also work through the MetaBrain parameter count to make sure the ~12M figure is accurate. With 3 LoRA experts, each using rank-16 on the Q/K/V/O projections across 18 attention layers, and assuming a model dimension around 2048, I can calculate the exact parameter footprint per projection.\n\nLooking at the actual numbers from the config, each expert has about 3.7M trainable parameters, so 3 experts gives roughly 11.1M, plus the PAR router adds another 0.5M, which checks out to about 12M total. For the rank-48 universal variant, scaling linearly by the rank ratio gives around 11M, which is consistent.\n\nBut wait, let me verify the rank-48 calculation more carefully. If each LoRA module at rank 48 has 2 × 2048 × 48 parameters per projection, that's actually closer to 14.2M across all 72 modules—higher than the 12M target. Let me work backwards from the known parameter count to figure out the actual embedding dimension.\n\nActually, I'm realizing the embedding dimension is 1600, not 2048. So at rank 48 with 72 modules, I get exactly 11.1M parameters, which perfectly matches the 3 experts at rank 16. The router adds another 0.5M, bringing Meta-Brain to about 11.6M total—so the rank-48 universal approach is essentially parameter-matched to the expert mixture, just with slightly fewer parameters overall since it doesn't need the routing overhead.\n\nNow I'm working through the FTM comparison numbers. The published 90% on visual perturbations was on a different backbone and eval setup, so my reproduction on pi0 gives 75.7%—lower but more directly comparable since it's the same backbone and LIBERO-Plus perturbations are likely more challenging. I'll use that for the fair comparison and write out the final YAML configuration.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13968,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13968},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"054151bb-bf21-4379-a32a-a5d1d8e38ee7","uuid":"680ffec2-960e-4b26-ad62-f3def6c826ef"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0159Wnv2R56ZrE24tLA75Cue","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing holds without modification. Headline: \"Meta-Brain achieves 78.9%\n  on LIBERO-Plus with ~12M params, outperforming parameter-matched rank-48 universal\n  LoRA by 13.8pp — perturbation-diagnostic routing is a more efficient use of\n  adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\" Ablation ladder strictly monotonic:\n  Frozen (53.6) < Universal-r16 (62.4) < Universal-r48 (65.1) < Random (65.8) <\n  Meta-Brain (78.9) < Oracle (80.7). Existential control (rank-48 universal) cleanly\n  defeated. Random routing offers negligible gain over universal-r48 (+0.7pp, p=0.38,\n  n.s.), ruling out ensemble effects. Oracle gap only 1.8pp, confirming PAR router\n  quality. Clean LIBERO preserved (+0.3pp). Cross-type mismatch drop avg 17.4pp\n  validates expert specialization. Rank sweep shows benefit monotonically increasing\n  (13.8→13.9→14.2pp). All 3 claims stand at full strength. Paper structure: Phase 0\n  finding → architecture → ablation ladder → per-perturbation cross-type analysis →\n  rank sweep → parameter efficiency. Bibliography covers MoE routing (Switch\n  Transformer, GShard, ST-MoE, V-MoE), VLA robustness (VLA-GSE, SAFE, RobustVLA,\n  FTM, FLA, SRPO, CorridorVLA), LoRA adaptation (LoRA, LoRA-SP, MoIRA, CORAL,\n  AdaLoRA, DoRA), VLA foundations (pi0, OpenVLA, SmolVLA, Octo, RT-2), benchmarks\n  (LIBERO, LIBERO-Plus), reaching 30+ refs comfortably.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA Expert Training — 3 Specialized + 1 Universal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, Q/K/V/O on all 18 PaliGemma layers, 3.7M\n      params each): LoRA-V (online visual augmentation), LoRA-S (oracle spatial demos),\n      LoRA-P (oracle physical demos), Universal (mixed all-perturbation data).\n      Evaluate each expert on its matched type AND cross-type.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_on_visual: 80.2\n      lora_v_on_spatial: 62.0\n      lora_v_on_physical: 60.2\n      lora_s_on_visual: 59.5\n      lora_s_on_spatial: 77.5\n      lora_s_on_physical: 60.0\n      lora_p_on_visual: 58.2\n      lora_p_on_spatial: 60.8\n      lora_p_on_physical: 74.8\n      universal_r16_visual: 64.8\n      universal_r16_spatial: 60.5\n      universal_r16_physical: 58.2\n      universal_r16_overall: 62.4\n      cross_type_avg_drop_pp: 17.4\n      val_action_mse_lora_v: 0.0082\n      val_action_mse_lora_s: 0.0091\n      val_action_mse_lora_p: 0.0098\n      val_action_mse_universal: 0.0105\n      convergence_epochs: 15\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 best 档下，perturbation-specific LoRA 学到了质性不同的修正模式。LoRA-V 在\n      视觉扰动上达到 80.2%（+29.4pp over frozen），因为在线增强（camera jitter,\n      brightness shift, background swap, Gaussian noise）精确匹配 LIBERO-Plus 视觉\n      扰动分布，LoRA 只需学习 early-layer visual representation 的低秩修正。LoRA-S\n      和 LoRA-P 在各自类型上分别达到 77.5%/74.8%，略低于 LoRA-V，原因有二：(1) spatial\n      和 physical 的 oracle demo 采集本身引入采集噪声；(2) 空间和物理扰动涉及\n      action-level 的高层语义调整，比纯视觉修正的 representation 变换更复杂。\n      关键证据在 cross-type performance：LoRA-V 在 spatial 上仅 62.0%（drop 18.2pp），\n      因为视觉修正无法纠正 layout 引起的 action trajectory 偏移——这两种修正在\n      representation space 中方向正交。LoRA-P 在 visual 上仅 58.2%（drop 16.6pp），\n      因为力学修正作用于 late-layer action planning，反而干扰了本该保持的 early-layer\n      visual features。cross-type 仍高于 frozen（58-62% vs 50-57%），说明 experts\n      学到了部分可迁移的通用 robustness（如 LoRA 的低秩约束本身有 regularization 效果），\n      但 type-specific 部分不可互换。Universal LoRA 在各类型上均为中等水平（58-65%），\n      是典型的 jack-of-all-trades：3.7M 参数被迫在三种修正方向之间妥协，\n      每个方向分到的有效容量不足以匹配专有 expert。Val MSE 证实了这一点：专有 expert\n      （0.008-0.010）显著低于 universal（0.0105），说明 specialization 带来更精确的\n      action prediction。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-type evaluation matrix\"\n        description: >\n          3×3 expert-vs-type matrix + universal 行。对角线显著高于非对角线\n          （avg drop 17.4pp），验证修正不可互换。\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Expert \\\\ Type\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"LoRA-V\", \"80.2 ★\", \"62.0\", \"60.2\"]\n            - [\"LoRA-S\", \"59.5\", \"77.5 ★\", \"60.0\"]\n            - [\"LoRA-P\", \"58.2\", \"60.8\", \"74.8 ★\"]\n            - [\"Universal-r16\", \"64.8\", \"60.5\", \"58.2\"]\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap of cross-type matrix, diagonal cells green, off-diagonal cells orange/red, showing 15-20pp drop\"\n      - \"Training loss curves: 4 LoRA adapters, showing convergence at ~15 epochs\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-type drop 全部 >15pp（最小 15.3pp for LoRA-P on spatial，最大 19.1pp\n      for LoRA-V on spatial/physical avg），直接验证 Claim 2 的前提假设。Universal LoRA\n      在所有类型上都不如对应的 matched expert（差距 12-17pp），确立了 routing 的必要性。\n\n  - name: \"Meta-Brain Assembly — PAR Router + LoRA Bank E2E\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      组装 PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP, first-token pooling) + 3 LoRA\n      experts，soft routing: h_corrected = h_frozen + Σ_k p(type_k)·LoRA_k(h_frozen)。\n      冻结 LoRA 参数，仅微调 PAR routing weights。全 LIBERO-Plus benchmark 评估。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_overall: 78.9\n      libero_plus_std: 1.2\n      per_type_visual: 81.2\n      per_type_spatial: 77.5\n      per_type_physical: 74.8\n      per_subtype_camera: 78.5\n      per_subtype_light: 83.8\n      per_subtype_background: 80.2\n      per_subtype_noise: 82.1\n      per_subtype_layout: 77.5\n      per_subtype_robot: 74.8\n      routing_weight_visual_on_lora_v: 0.91\n      routing_weight_spatial_on_lora_s: 0.88\n      routing_weight_physical_on_lora_p: 0.86\n      routing_entropy_visual: 0.12\n      routing_entropy_spatial: 0.15\n      routing_entropy_physical: 0.18\n      par_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n      e2e_finetuning_epochs: 5\n      total_trainable_params_M: 11.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      78.9% 整体成功率来自三个因素的协同：(1) PAR router routing accuracy 达 96.8%——\n      Phase 0 已证明 layer 6 first-token 激活在 3-class 上 F1=1.0，端到端微调只需\n      轻微校准 soft routing 的温度参数；(2) soft routing entropy 极低（0.12-0.18），\n      说明 router 对每种扰动类型高度确信，routing weights 近似 one-hot（视觉扰动时\n      LoRA-V 权重 0.91），使 Meta-Brain 在运行时近似 oracle routing——这直接解释了\n      oracle gap 仅 1.8pp；(3) 各 expert 本身质量高（plan_002 验证），routing 只需\n      选对 expert 即可。per-type 排序 V>S>P（81.2>77.5>74.8）反映了扰动修正的内在\n      难度梯度：视觉扰动是最规则的低秩变换（brightness/contrast 近似线性），空间扰动\n      需要调整 mid-level spatial reasoning，物理扰动涉及 action planning 的高层语义\n      重构。per-subtype 中 light 最高（83.8%）因为亮度变化是最平滑的视觉扰动，\n      camera 稍低（78.5%）因为视角变化需要更复杂的几何 re-projection。Physical\n      expert 的 routing confidence 稍低（0.86 vs 0.91）因为物理扰动在激活空间中的\n      cluster 略松散（Phase 0: physical F1=0.951 at K=1 vs spatial F1=1.0）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Perturbation\", \"Type\", \"Success (%)\", \"Δ Frozen (pp)\", \"Routing Weight\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Camera\", \"Visual\", \"78.5\", \"+30.3\", \"LoRA-V: 0.92\"]\n            - [\"Light\", \"Visual\", \"83.8\", \"+31.3\", \"LoRA-V: 0.93\"]\n            - [\"Background\", \"Visual\", \"80.2\", \"+29.4\", \"LoRA-V: 0.90\"]\n            - [\"Noise\", \"Visual\", \"82.1\", \"+28.9\", \"LoRA-V: 0.89\"]\n            - [\"Layout\", \"Spatial\", \"77.5\", \"+20.0\", \"LoRA-S: 0.88\"]\n            - [\"Robot\", \"Physical\", \"74.8\", \"+18.6\", \"LoRA-P: 0.86\"]\n            - [\"Overall\", \"—\", \"78.9\", \"+25.3\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PAR routing weight heatmap 3×3: rows=input perturbation type, cols=LoRA expert, near-diagonal structure\"\n      - \"Per-subtype grouped bar chart: Meta-Brain vs Frozen pi0, gain annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      78.9% overall + near-diagonal routing weights + 96.8% routing accuracy 共同\n      构成 best 档核心证据。routing entropy 的 per-type 差异（0.12 visual vs 0.18\n      physical）反映了 Phase 0 分类精度的差异——但即使 physical 的 entropy 也远低于\n      maximum（0.18 vs log(3)=1.10），确认所有类型的 routing 都高度确定。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Routing Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      用 ground-truth 扰动类型标签（hard one-hot）替换 PAR router，测量 learned\n      routing 与 perfect routing 的上界差距。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_overall: 80.7\n      oracle_std: 0.9\n      oracle_visual: 83.0\n      oracle_spatial: 79.2\n      oracle_physical: 76.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall: 1.8\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual: 1.8\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial: 1.7\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical: 1.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      Oracle routing 达到 80.7%，仅比 Meta-Brain（78.9%）高 1.8pp。Gap 小于 routing\n      分类错误率所预测的值（routing accuracy 96.8% → 3.2% 错误 → 预期 impact ~3pp），\n      因为 PAR 的 soft routing 在分类不完全正确时仍分配了较高权重给正确 expert\n      （如 misrouted visual 案例中 LoRA-V 仍获 0.65 权重 vs LoRA-S 0.35），使得\n      routing error 的 downstream impact 被 dampen。per-type gap 高度一致\n      （1.7-1.8pp），说明 PAR router 在三种类型上的性能均衡，没有系统性偏向。\n      Physical 的 oracle gap（1.7pp）最小，看似反直觉（physical 的 routing accuracy\n      最低），但 physical expert 的 cross-type performance（60.0-60.8%）高于其他\n      expert 的 cross-type（58.2-62.0%），使得 misrouting 的惩罚较轻。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Meta-Brain vs Oracle per-type, error bars from 5 seeds, gap annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      1.8pp gap 证明 PAR router 不是系统瓶颈。未来提升应聚焦于 expert 质量\n      （更好训练数据、更高 rank）而非 router 改进。Oracle 结果也为 routing 设定了\n      performance ceiling：~80.7% 是 rank-16 expert bank 的理论上限。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation Ladder — Full Systematic Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 上 6 个系统配置的系统对比（5 seeds）：Frozen → Universal-r16 →\n      Universal-r48 → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle。包含 rank-48\n      parameter-matched control 和 random routing baseline。\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_overall: 53.6\n      frozen_pi0_std: 0.8\n      universal_r16_overall: 62.4\n      universal_r16_std: 1.4\n      universal_r48_overall: 65.1\n      universal_r48_std: 1.3\n      random_routing_overall: 65.8\n      random_routing_std: 2.1\n      meta_brain_overall: 78.9\n      meta_brain_std: 1.2\n      oracle_routing_overall: 80.7\n      oracle_routing_std: 0.9\n      step_frozen_to_r16: 8.8\n      step_r16_to_r48: 2.7\n      step_r48_to_random: 0.7\n      step_random_to_meta_brain: 13.1\n      step_meta_brain_to_oracle: 1.8\n      routing_gap_vs_rank48: 13.8\n      routing_gap_vs_random: 13.1\n      random_vs_r48_pvalue: 0.38\n      meta_brain_vs_random_pvalue: 0.00003\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_pvalue: 0.00001\n      per_type_visual_frozen: 50.8\n      per_type_spatial_frozen: 57.5\n      per_type_physical_frozen: 56.2\n      per_type_visual_r48: 67.5\n      per_type_spatial_r48: 63.2\n      per_type_physical_r48: 60.8\n      per_type_visual_random: 66.8\n      per_type_spatial_random: 65.5\n      per_type_physical_random: 63.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      消融梯度严格单调递增（53.6→62.4→65.1→65.8→78.9→80.7），每一步对应一个\n      独立的能力维度：\n      (1) Frozen→r16（+8.8pp）：LoRA 本身提供了通用的 representation correction 能力，\n      即使不区分扰动类型，低秩修正也能改善 feature robustness。\n      (2) r16→r48（+2.7pp）：增加 rank 有帮助但收益递减——3.2× 参数仅换来 2.7pp，\n      说明 universal correction 的 capacity utilization efficiency 随 rank 下降，\n      因为额外参数被迫在三种互斥修正方向上妥协。\n      (3) r48→Random（+0.7pp, p=0.38 不显著）：仅 3 个 expert 的 ensemble 效应\n      几乎不存在。Random routing 有时碰巧选对 expert（1/3 概率），拉高了均值，\n      但也有 2/3 概率选错并导致 suboptimal correction。这两个效应近似抵消，\n      使 random 仅比 universal 高 0.7pp。p=0.38 的不显著性是关键 null result——\n      它排除了 \"Meta-Brain 的好处来自 ensemble averaging\" 的 alternative explanation。\n      (4) Random→Meta-Brain（+13.1pp, p<0.001）：整个梯度中最大的单步跳跃。\n      精确 routing 带来的提升远超 capacity scaling（2.7pp）和 ensemble（0.7pp）的\n      总和——routing 的边际贡献（13.1pp）是 capacity scaling（2.7pp）的 4.9×。\n      这是 Claim 2 的核心量化证据。\n      (5) Meta-Brain→Oracle（+1.8pp）：PAR router 接近理论上限。\n      Random routing 的高 std（2.1 vs Meta-Brain 的 1.2）反映了随机 expert 分配的\n      天然不稳定性——在某些 seed 下碰巧匹配较多，在其他 seed 下则严重不匹配。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Ablation Ladder — Main Results (5 seeds)\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\", \"Δ Frozen\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"53.6 ± 0.8\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"62.4 ± 1.4\", \"64.8\", \"60.5\", \"58.2\", \"+8.8\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"12M\", \"65.1 ± 1.3\", \"67.5\", \"63.2\", \"60.8\", \"+11.5\"]\n            - [\"Random Routing\", \"12M\", \"65.8 ± 2.1\", \"66.8\", \"65.5\", \"63.2\", \"+12.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (ours)\", \"12M\", \"78.9 ± 1.2\", \"81.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\", \"+25.3\"]\n            - [\"Oracle Routing\", \"12M\", \"80.7 ± 0.9\", \"83.0\", \"79.2\", \"76.5\", \"+27.1\"]\n      - name: \"Statistical significance\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Comparison\", \"Gap (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Significant?\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Meta-Brain vs r48\", \"13.8\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes (***)\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain vs Random\", \"13.1\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes (***)\"]\n            - [\"Random vs r48\", \"0.7\", \"0.38\", \"No (n.s.)\"]\n            - [\"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\", \"1.8\", \"0.03\", \"Yes (*)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 6 bars in ablation order, color-coded cold→warm, 5-seed error bars, significance brackets\"\n      - \"Decomposition pie chart: routing contribution (13.1pp) vs capacity (2.7pp) vs ensemble (0.7pp) vs baseline (8.8pp)\"\n    analysis: >\n      消融梯度提供三个推论：(a) routing >> ensemble（13.1pp vs 0.7pp, ratio 18.7×）；\n      (b) routing >> capacity scaling（13.8pp vs 2.7pp, ratio 5.1×）；\n      (c) PAR ≈ oracle（gap 1.8pp）。Random vs r48 的 null result（p=0.38）是\n      全文最关键的 negative finding——它排除了 Claim 2 的唯一 alternative explanation。\n\n  - name: \"FTM/FLA Reproduction — Visual-Only Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 pi0 backbone 上复现 FTM（Fine-Tuning Masking），对比 FTM vs Meta-Brain\n      在视觉扰动上的表现，并展示 Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上的独特优势。\n    expected_results:\n      ftm_visual_avg: 75.7\n      ftm_camera: 73.2\n      ftm_light: 78.5\n      ftm_background: 74.8\n      ftm_noise: 76.2\n      ftm_spatial: 55.8\n      ftm_physical: 54.5\n      ftm_overall: 65.2\n      ftm_params_K: 4\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_visual_gap: 5.5\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_spatial_gap: 21.7\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_physical_gap: 20.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      FTM 在 pi0 上复现后视觉扰动达 75.7%（+24.9pp over frozen），以极少参数（4K）\n      实现了可观修正，验证了 FTM 的 feature masking 原理在 pi0 上同样有效——\n      masking 通过抑制 early-layer 中被扰动 corrupted 的 feature channel 来恢复\n      clean representation。但 FTM 在 spatial（55.8%）和 physical（54.5%）上等同于\n      frozen baseline 甚至略低（spatial -1.7pp），因为 FTM 的核心假设是扰动破坏\n      视觉特征——对 layout 变化或机器人初始状态变化，masking visual channels 不仅\n      无益反而可能抑制有用的 spatial/physical 信号。Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上也高于\n      FTM（81.2% vs 75.7%，+5.5pp），因为 rank-16 LoRA（3.7M params）比 feature\n      masking（4K params）有更大的修正表达能力——LoRA 可以 rotate 和 scale 整个\n      subspace，而 masking 只能 zero-out channels。但 FTM 的极高参数效率\n      （4K params for +24.9pp on visual）使其在 visual-only 场景下仍然有独特价值。\n      核心对比：Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上分别高出 FTM 21.7pp 和 20.3pp，\n      这正是 multi-type routing 的 unique value proposition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"FTM vs Meta-Brain comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\", \"Overall (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\", \"53.6\"]\n            - [\"FTM (reprod.)\", \"4K\", \"75.7\", \"55.8\", \"54.5\", \"65.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12M\", \"81.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\", \"78.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Visual/Spatial/Physical, 3 bars each (Frozen, FTM, Meta-Brain), showing FTM's visual-only strength\"\n    analysis: >\n      FTM 是 visual-only robustness 的 strong baseline，且参数效率极高。论文中应定位为\n      \"single-modality approach 的代表\"——它证明了 visual 修正可以极其高效，\n      但也证明了 single-modality 无法推广到 multi-type perturbation 场景。\n      Meta-Brain 即使在 visual-only 上也优于 FTM（+5.5pp），说明 LoRA-based correction\n      比 feature masking 更有表达力。\n\n  - name: \"Parameter Efficiency Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      计算各方法的 gain-over-frozen-baseline，按可训练参数归一化，\n      绘制 parameter efficiency scatter plot。纯分析，无 GPU 计算。\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_gain_pp: 25.3\n      meta_brain_params_M: 12\n      meta_brain_gain_per_M: 2.11\n      universal_r16_gain_pp: 8.8\n      universal_r16_params_M: 3.7\n      universal_r16_gain_per_M: 2.38\n      universal_r48_gain_pp: 11.5\n      universal_r48_params_M: 12\n      universal_r48_gain_per_M: 0.96\n      ftm_gain_visual_pp: 24.9\n      ftm_gain_overall_pp: 11.6\n      ftm_params_M: 0.004\n      ftm_gain_per_M_visual: 6225.0\n      ftm_gain_per_M_overall: 2900.0\n      vla_gse_gain_pp: 12.0\n      vla_gse_params_M: 114\n      vla_gse_gain_per_M: 0.105\n      meta_brain_pareto_optimal: true\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_efficiency_ratio: 2.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      参数效率分析揭示了三个 regime：(1) 极低参数区（<1M）：FTM 以 4K params 在\n      visual-only 上达到 gain_per_M=6225，但 overall gain_per_M（2900）反映了它\n      无法覆盖 non-visual 的局限；(2) 中等参数区（1-15M）：Meta-Brain 占据 Pareto\n      前沿——12M params, 25.3pp gain, gain_per_M=2.11。同参数量的 Universal-r48\n      仅 gain_per_M=0.96，效率差 2.2×。这 2.2× 的效率倍数就是 routing 的量化贡献；\n      (3) 高参数区（>100M）：VLA-GSE 的 114M params 仅提供 gain_per_M=0.105\n      （不同 backbone，仅作 suggestive 对比）。即使考虑 backbone 差异，Meta-Brain 的\n      gain_per_M（2.11）比 VLA-GSE（0.105）高 20×，数量级差异足以支撑 parameter\n      efficiency narrative。Universal r16 的 gain_per_M（2.38）看似高于 Meta-Brain\n      （2.11），但绝对 gain 仅 8.8pp vs 25.3pp——在 \"达到实用性能阈值\" 的约束下，\n      r16 的高效率无意义，因为 62.4% 可能低于部署要求。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter efficiency summary\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Backbone\", \"Params\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"Gain/M\", \"Coverage\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"FTM\", \"pi0\", \"4K\", \"+24.9 (V) / +11.6 (all)\", \"6225 / 2900\", \"Visual only\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"pi0\", \"3.7M\", \"+8.8\", \"2.38\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (ours)\", \"pi0\", \"12M\", \"+25.3\", \"2.11\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"pi0\", \"12M\", \"+11.5\", \"0.96\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"VLA-GSE †\", \"Qwen3-4B\", \"114M\", \"+12.0\", \"0.105\", \"All types\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=trainable params (log scale), y=gain-over-frozen (pp). Meta-Brain on Pareto front. FTM in ultra-low-param corner. VLA-GSE in high-param low-efficiency region (dashed circle, different backbone). Isoquants of gain_per_M as diagonal lines.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Meta-Brain 是 multi-type robustness 场景下的 Pareto optimal 方法。关键 insight：\n      routing 让同等参数预算（12M）的效率提升 2.2×——这不是 architectural overhead\n      的代价，而是 capacity allocation strategy 的收益。Parameter efficiency scatter\n      是 Claim 3 的 primary visual evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Correction Memory Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      对比 Meta-Brain with/without Correction Memory (CM)，量化 CM 的边际收益。\n      CM 通过 FAISS 检索相似历史扰动的 routing weight 来调制当前 routing。\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_no_cm: 78.9\n      meta_brain_with_cm: 80.1\n      cm_delta_overall: 1.2\n      cm_delta_visual: 0.8\n      cm_delta_spatial: 1.5\n      cm_delta_physical: 1.8\n      cm_additional_params: 1\n      cm_latency_overhead_ms: 2.3\n      cm_pvalue: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      CM 提供 +1.2pp 整体提升（p=0.08, borderline significant with 5 seeds），\n      主要来自 spatial（+1.5pp）和 physical（+1.8pp）而非 visual（+0.8pp）。\n      这符合 CM 的设计逻辑：CM 检索与当前 observation 最相似的历史扰动 exemplar，\n      用其 routing weight 作为 contextual prior 来调制 PAR 输出。Spatial 和 physical\n      扰动的 within-type 变异更大（不同 layout randomization 的具体形态差异远大于\n      不同 lighting condition），历史 exemplar 能提供有用的 \"这种具体 layout 变化\n      应该如何调整 routing\" 的信息。Visual 上 CM 收益小因为 PAR 对视觉扰动已经\n      足够准确（routing accuracy ~98% on visual），contextual modulation 的改进空间\n      有限。但 +1.2pp 的总收益与 1 个额外可学习参数 + 2.3ms CPU latency 相比，\n      cost-benefit 偏低——不值得作为 named architectural component 推广。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation bar chart: with/without CM, per-type Δ annotated, p-value shown\"\n    analysis: >\n      CM 是 optional module，+1.2pp 不改变任何 claim 的结论。论文呈现策略：\n      一行 ablation 文字 + footnote table，明确标注 \"optional, borderline significant\"。\n      Dream reviewers 一致认为 CM 是 padding，降级处理是正确决策。\n\n  - name: \"Router Architecture Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      对比 3 种 PAR router 变体：2-layer MLP (default), linear classifier,\n      attention-based router。均使用 PaliGemma layer 6 first-token features。\n    expected_results:\n      mlp_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n      mlp_downstream: 78.9\n      mlp_params_M: 0.53\n      linear_routing_accuracy: 94.2\n      linear_downstream: 76.8\n      linear_params_M: 0.01\n      attention_routing_accuracy: 97.1\n      attention_downstream: 78.5\n      attention_params_M: 1.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP（96.8% routing, 78.9% downstream）是最优 cost-performance 均衡。Linear\n      分类器准确率低 2.6pp（94.2%），因为 3-class 边界在激活空间中有轻微非线性——\n      Phase 0 t-SNE 显示 Spatial/Physical cluster 的边界不完全线性可分（两者都\n      影响 action space，共享部分特征），MLP 的一层隐藏层足以 model 这个非线性。\n      2.6pp routing gap 转化为 2.1pp downstream gap（76.8% vs 78.9%），说明\n      routing accuracy 和 task success 近似线性相关但有 damping（soft routing\n      缓冲了部分 routing error）。Attention-based router routing accuracy 最高\n      （97.1%），但 downstream 反而略低（78.5%），因为 1.85M 额外参数在仅 5 epoch\n      微调下轻微 overfit——attention 的表达能力对 3-class routing 过剩。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router architecture comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Router Type\", \"Params (M)\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Downstream (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Linear\", \"0.01\", \"94.2\", \"76.8\"]\n            - [\"2-layer MLP ★\", \"0.53\", \"96.8\", \"78.9\"]\n            - [\"Attention\", \"1.85\", \"97.1\", \"78.5\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Router 架构的 downstream impact 有限（max spread 2.1pp），说明 Meta-Brain\n      的性能主要由 routing 原理和 expert 质量驱动，而非 router 实现细节。\n      论文中作简短 ablation paragraph 处理。\n\n  - name: \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      对比 6-class 精细路由（camera/light/background/noise/layout/robot 各一个\n      LoRA expert，6×3.7M=22.1M params）vs 3-class 粗路由（Visual/Spatial/Physical，\n      3×3.7M=11.1M params）。\n    expected_results:\n      3class_overall: 78.9\n      3class_params_M: 12\n      6class_overall: 79.6\n      6class_params_M: 24\n      6class_delta: 0.7\n      6class_camera: 80.2\n      6class_light: 84.5\n      6class_background: 81.0\n      6class_noise: 83.2\n      6class_layout: 77.8\n      6class_robot: 75.1\n      marginal_gain_per_expert: 0.23\n      6class_routing_accuracy: 94.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      6-class 仅比 3-class 高 0.7pp（79.6% vs 78.9%），参数量翻倍（24M vs 12M），\n      每额外 expert 的边际收益仅 0.23pp。这与 Phase 0 的发现一致：intra-Visual\n      4 个 sub-type 在激活空间中形成一个紧致 cluster（6-class accuracy 99.8% 但\n      sub-type 间 cosine similarity 高达 0.92），说明 camera/light/background/noise\n      的修正策略高度重叠——它们都影响 early-layer visual representation，差异更多是\n      程度而非类型。Independent camera expert 比 shared LoRA-V 仅高 1.7pp（80.2%\n      vs 78.5%），代价是独占 3.7M 参数。同时 6-class routing accuracy 下降到 94.8%\n      （vs 3-class 96.8%），因为 6-class 边界更精细，分类更困难，少量 routing error\n      部分抵消了 expert specialization 的收益。3-class 是 granularity 的 sweet spot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Granularity comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Granularity\", \"Experts\", \"Total Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Δ\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"3-class\", \"3\", \"12M\", \"78.9\", \"96.8\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"6-class\", \"6\", \"24M\", \"79.6\", \"94.8\", \"+0.7\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      0.7pp / 2× params 的 trade-off 验证了 3-class taxonomy 的合理性，回应\n      Reviewer C5。Phase 0 的 Visual cluster 紧致性是根本原因——finer granularity\n      within Visual 增加 routing 难度但不增加修正多样性。\n\n  - name: \"Rank-48 Parameter-Matched Universal LoRA — Existential Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      训练 rank-48 universal LoRA（~11.1M params，精确匹配 Meta-Brain 的 3×rank-16\n      expert 参数总量）。若 rank-48 ≈ Meta-Brain → Claim 2 崩溃。\n    expected_results:\n      rank48_overall: 65.1\n      rank48_std: 1.3\n      rank48_visual: 67.5\n      rank48_spatial: 63.2\n      rank48_physical: 60.8\n      rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap: 13.8\n      rank48_vs_r16_improvement: 2.7\n      rank48_gain_over_frozen: 11.5\n      rank48_gain_per_M: 0.96\n      claim2_survival: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank-48 universal LoRA 达到 65.1%（+11.5pp over frozen），仅比 rank-16\n      （62.4%）高 2.7pp，despite 3.2× 参数增长（3.7M → 11.1M）。这证实了\n      \"universal capacity saturation\" 假设：uniform LoRA 的收益在 rank 16-48\n      之间快速递减。根本原因：rank-48 的 11.1M 参数被迫在三种修正方向（visual:\n      early-layer re-projection, spatial: mid-layer trajectory adjustment, physical:\n      late-layer action re-planning）之间共享。这三种修正在 representation space 中\n      方向不同甚至互斥——改善 visual robustness 的 rank 方向可能削弱 spatial 性能。\n      增加 rank 只是增加了妥协的参数量，无法解决方向冲突。per-type 分布清晰展示了\n      这个困境：Visual（67.5%）的 gain over frozen（+16.7pp）远大于 Spatial（+5.7pp）\n      和 Physical（+4.6pp），因为 visual perturbation 在混合训练数据中占 4/6 sub-types，\n      universal LoRA 被 biased toward visual correction。Meta-Brain 的 3 experts\n      各自专注一种类型，消除了方向冲突和数据 imbalance。13.8pp gap（p<0.001）\n      是 Claim 2 的 existential validation：identical parameter budget,\n      dramatically different outcome。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedded in ablation ladder figure: rank-48 bar annotated with '= Meta-Brain params' and 13.8pp gap arrow\"\n    analysis: >\n      全文最关键的单个实验。13.8pp gap + p<0.001 直接证明 routing 的价值不可被\n      parameter scaling 替代。如果这个 gap <5pp，整篇论文的 thesis 就需要根本性重构。\n      在 best 档下，gap 足够大且稳健，Claim 2 完整存活。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Rank Sweep (r=16/32/64)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      在 r=16/32/64 三个 expert rank 上分别训练 Meta-Brain 和 parameter-matched\n      universal LoRA，测试 routing benefit 是否随 expert capacity 增长而变化。\n    expected_results:\n      r16_meta_brain: 78.9\n      r16_universal_matched: 65.1\n      r16_routing_benefit: 13.8\n      r16_total_params_M: 12\n      r32_meta_brain: 81.5\n      r32_universal_matched: 67.6\n      r32_routing_benefit: 13.9\n      r32_total_params_M: 24\n      r64_meta_brain: 84.2\n      r64_universal_matched: 70.0\n      r64_routing_benefit: 14.2\n      r64_total_params_M: 48\n      benefit_trend: \"monotonically increasing\"\n      universal_diminishing_returns_r48_to_r96: 2.5\n      universal_diminishing_returns_r96_to_r192: 2.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Routing benefit 单调递增（13.8→13.9→14.2pp），排除了 Dream worst-case\n      \"routing benefit 仅在特定 capacity 下出现\" 的顾虑。递增的机制：\n      (1) 更高 rank 的 expert 能捕获更精细的 type-specific correction（r=64 LoRA-V\n      on visual ~86%），这些精细修正的价值在 universal setting 下被 dilute 掉——\n      universal 必须在三种修正之间分配每一个 rank component。\n      (2) Universal LoRA 的 scaling 呈递减：r48→r96 仅 +2.5pp, r96→r192 仅 +2.4pp，\n      因为额外 rank 被用于 refine 已有的妥协方案，而非学习新的修正维度。\n      (3) Meta-Brain 的 scaling 近似线性（78.9→81.5→84.2，每次 ~+2.6pp），\n      因为每个 expert 的额外 rank 直接用于 deepen 该类型的专有修正，没有 cross-type\n      interference。两条 scaling curve 的斜率差导致 benefit gap 缓慢扩大。\n      这个 finding 的叙事意义：routing benefit 不是特定 capacity 的 artifact，\n      而是 fundamental architectural advantage——无论参数预算大小，routing 始终优于\n      uniform correction。如果有更多参数预算，应投入到更高 rank 的 routed experts。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Rank sweep results\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Expert Rank\", \"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"Matched Universal (%)\", \"Routing Benefit (pp)\", \"Total Params\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"r=16\", \"78.9\", \"65.1\", \"13.8\", \"12M\"]\n            - [\"r=32\", \"81.5\", \"67.6\", \"13.9\", \"24M\"]\n            - [\"r=64\", \"84.2\", \"70.0\", \"14.2\", \"48M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=rank (log scale), y=success rate. Two lines (Meta-Brain, Universal), diverging gap annotated at each rank\"\n    analysis: >\n      Monotonically increasing routing benefit 是一个 clean scaling result。\n      它也暗示 r=64 Meta-Brain（84.2%）可以 match 或超过 VLA-GSE（81.2%，不同\n      backbone），虽然 cross-backbone 对比是 indirect，但趋势线的 extrapolation\n      支持 Meta-Brain 在更高 capacity 下的 competitive potential。\n\n  - name: \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      在标准（无扰动）LIBERO 上评估 Meta-Brain 和 baselines，验证 routing 不会\n      降低 nominal performance。\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_clean: 91.2\n      universal_r16_clean: 90.8\n      universal_r48_clean: 90.5\n      meta_brain_clean: 91.5\n      clean_delta_meta_brain: 0.3\n      clean_delta_r16: -0.4\n      clean_delta_r48: -0.7\n      par_routing_entropy_on_clean: 0.85\n      par_routing_weight_distribution_clean: \"≈ 0.34/0.33/0.33\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Meta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上 91.5%（Δ=+0.3pp vs frozen），完全保持 nominal\n      性能。这得益于 PAR router 的一个 emergent 行为：在无扰动输入下，layer 6\n      first-token 激活不匹配任何已知扰动 pattern，PAR 输出高 entropy（0.85，\n      接近 max log(3)=1.10），routing weights 近似均匀（~0.33/0.33/0.33）。\n      三个 expert 的修正在 clean input 上大致方向相反（各自 tuned 为不同扰动的\n      correction），均匀加权后 net correction ≈ 0——routing 自动 degrade to\n      identity。微弱的 +0.3pp 正 delta 可能来自 expert LoRA 的轻微 regularization\n      效果。对比 Universal LoRA：r16 下降 0.4pp, r48 下降 0.7pp，因为 universal\n      LoRA 始终应用 correction（无 \"关闭\" 机制），对 clean input 造成不必要的\n      representation perturbation。Rank 越高干扰越大（r48 的 -0.7pp），因为\n      higher-rank LoRA 的 representation 修改幅度更大。这为 deployment 增加了\n      重要论据：Meta-Brain 的 routing 机制在正常条件下安全 graceful degrade，\n      而 always-on universal correction 有代价。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Clean LIBERO preservation\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Clean LIBERO (%)\", \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"91.2\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"90.8\", \"-0.4\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"90.5\", \"-0.7\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"91.5\", \"+0.3\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Clean LIBERO preservation 是 practical deployment argument 的关键证据。\n      Meta-Brain 是唯一在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都不降级的方法。PAR routing 的\n      high-entropy fallback 是一个 emergent property（非刻意设计），可作为\n      \"routing 自动 detect perturbation absence\" 的附加 insight 呈现。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Backbone Validation (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 SmolVLA 上复现 Phase 0 + Phase 1 核心 pipeline，验证 perturbation-diagnostic\n      routing 的跨架构泛化性。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      smolvla_phase0_3class_f1: 0.971\n      smolvla_phase0_best_layer: 4\n      smolvla_frozen_libero_plus: 49.8\n      smolvla_universal_r16: 58.2\n      smolvla_meta_brain: 72.4\n      smolvla_gain_over_frozen: 22.6\n      smolvla_routing_benefit_vs_universal: 14.2\n      smolvla_routing_accuracy: 94.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      SmolVLA Phase 0 F1=0.971（vs pi0 0.993），略低但仍极高，验证了 perturbation\n      diagnosability 不是 PaliGemma 架构的特有属性。Best layer 是 layer 4\n      （SmolVLA 共 ~12 层），深度比例 ~1/3 与 pi0 的 layer 6/18 一致，\n      暗示 perturbation information 在 VLA 中的 consolidation 发生在相对一致的\n      depth fraction。Phase 0 F1 略低的原因：SmolVLA 的 representation 维度更小，\n      perturbation cluster 间的 margin 更窄，但仍足以支撑高质量 routing。\n      Meta-Brain on SmolVLA 达到 72.4%（+22.6pp over frozen 49.8%），\n      routing benefit vs universal 为 14.2pp（vs pi0 上的 13.8pp），定量吻合度很高。\n      SmolVLA 绝对性能低于 pi0（72.4% vs 78.9%）因为 backbone capacity 更小，\n      但 routing benefit 的相对大小几乎相同（14.2 vs 13.8），说明\n      routing 的价值不依赖于 backbone quality——无论 backbone 强弱，\n      perturbation-type-specific correction 都比 uniform correction 更高效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-backbone comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Metric\", \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\", \"SmolVLA\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Phase 0 3-class F1\", \"0.993\", \"0.971\"]\n            - [\"Best probing layer\", \"6 / 18\", \"4 / 12\"]\n            - [\"Frozen baseline (%)\", \"53.6\", \"49.8\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16 (%)\", \"62.4\", \"58.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"78.9\", \"72.4\"]\n            - [\"Routing benefit (pp)\", \"13.8\", \"14.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: pi0 vs SmolVLA, routing benefit annotated, showing consistency\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-backbone validation 将 contribution 从 \"pi0 上有效的 technique\" 提升为\n      \"VLA 的通用 robustness principle\"。routing benefit 在两个 backbone 上的\n      高度一致性（13.8 vs 14.2pp）是最有说服力的 generalization evidence。\n      直接回应 Reviewer C3。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Layer Placement Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      对比不同 PaliGemma 层覆盖范围（early 2-6, mid 6-12, late 12-16, all 2-16）\n      对各 expert type 的影响。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_early: 78.5\n      lora_v_mid: 76.2\n      lora_v_late: 72.8\n      lora_v_all: 80.2\n      lora_s_early: 73.5\n      lora_s_mid: 76.8\n      lora_s_late: 74.2\n      lora_s_all: 77.5\n      lora_p_early: 69.8\n      lora_p_mid: 72.5\n      lora_p_late: 74.5\n      lora_p_all: 74.8\n      v_best_subset: \"early (2-6)\"\n      s_best_subset: \"mid (6-12)\"\n      p_best_subset: \"late (12-16)\"\n      v_all_minus_best_subset: 1.7\n      s_all_minus_best_subset: 0.7\n      p_all_minus_best_subset: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer placement 揭示了清晰的 V→early, S→mid, P→late 偏好梯度：\n      LoRA-V 在 early layers 最优 subset（78.5%），因为视觉扰动（camera/light/\n      background/noise）破坏 early visual representation——在损坏发生处修正最高效。\n      Late layers（72.8%）最差（-7.4pp vs all），因为 corrupted features 已经\n      propagate 到深层并 compound，late-layer 修正无法 undo upstream corruption。\n      LoRA-S 在 mid layers 最优（76.8%），因为 spatial perturbation（layout 变化）\n      影响的是 visual-to-spatial reasoning 的转换阶段——mid layers 将 2D visual\n      features 转化为 3D spatial-action representations。LoRA-P 在 late layers\n      最优（74.5%），且与 all-layer（74.8%）仅差 0.3pp，因为 physical perturbation\n      （robot 初始状态变化）影响 high-level action planning，这发生在 late decision\n      layers。但所有 expert 在 all-layer 覆盖下均为最优或接近最优，说明 cross-layer\n      redundancy 有益——即使存在层偏好，拥有 all-layer coverage 可以 catch residual\n      perturbation effects at other layers。v_all_minus_best_subset 最大（1.7pp），\n      说明 visual perturbation 虽集中在 early layers 但 mid/late 仍有 residual impact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer placement ablation\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Layers\", \"LoRA-V Visual (%)\", \"LoRA-S Spatial (%)\", \"LoRA-P Physical (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Early (2-6)\", \"78.5 ★V\", \"73.5\", \"69.8\"]\n            - [\"Mid (6-12)\", \"76.2\", \"76.8 ★S\", \"72.5\"]\n            - [\"Late (12-16)\", \"72.8\", \"74.2\", \"74.5 ★P\"]\n            - [\"All (2-16)\", \"80.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×4 heatmap: rows=layer range, cols=expert type, ★=best subset per expert, diagonal pattern visible\"\n    analysis: >\n      V→early, S→mid, P→late 的对应关系提供了 mechanistic insight，支撑 \"不同扰动\n      影响不同处理阶段\" 的理论框架。这个 finding 虽然不影响主要 claim（all-layer\n      仍是实用最优），但作为 practical insight 增加了论文的理论深度。未来工作可\n      探索 layer-specific routing（根据扰动类型动态选择 active layers）。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13968,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13968},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"054151bb-bf21-4379-a32a-a5d1d8e38ee7","uuid":"f29efbb0-4fee-49cd-ba93-3e3eb8f1b676"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":962761,"duration_api_ms":964227,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing holds without modification. Headline: \"Meta-Brain achieves 78.9%\n  on LIBERO-Plus with ~12M params, outperforming parameter-matched rank-48 universal\n  LoRA by 13.8pp — perturbation-diagnostic routing is a more efficient use of\n  adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\" Ablation ladder strictly monotonic:\n  Frozen (53.6) < Universal-r16 (62.4) < Universal-r48 (65.1) < Random (65.8) <\n  Meta-Brain (78.9) < Oracle (80.7). Existential control (rank-48 universal) cleanly\n  defeated. Random routing offers negligible gain over universal-r48 (+0.7pp, p=0.38,\n  n.s.), ruling out ensemble effects. Oracle gap only 1.8pp, confirming PAR router\n  quality. Clean LIBERO preserved (+0.3pp). Cross-type mismatch drop avg 17.4pp\n  validates expert specialization. Rank sweep shows benefit monotonically increasing\n  (13.8→13.9→14.2pp). All 3 claims stand at full strength. Paper structure: Phase 0\n  finding → architecture → ablation ladder → per-perturbation cross-type analysis →\n  rank sweep → parameter efficiency. Bibliography covers MoE routing (Switch\n  Transformer, GShard, ST-MoE, V-MoE), VLA robustness (VLA-GSE, SAFE, RobustVLA,\n  FTM, FLA, SRPO, CorridorVLA), LoRA adaptation (LoRA, LoRA-SP, MoIRA, CORAL,\n  AdaLoRA, DoRA), VLA foundations (pi0, OpenVLA, SmolVLA, Octo, RT-2), benchmarks\n  (LIBERO, LIBERO-Plus), reaching 30+ refs comfortably.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA Expert Training — 3 Specialized + 1 Universal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, Q/K/V/O on all 18 PaliGemma layers, 3.7M\n      params each): LoRA-V (online visual augmentation), LoRA-S (oracle spatial demos),\n      LoRA-P (oracle physical demos), Universal (mixed all-perturbation data).\n      Evaluate each expert on its matched type AND cross-type.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_on_visual: 80.2\n      lora_v_on_spatial: 62.0\n      lora_v_on_physical: 60.2\n      lora_s_on_visual: 59.5\n      lora_s_on_spatial: 77.5\n      lora_s_on_physical: 60.0\n      lora_p_on_visual: 58.2\n      lora_p_on_spatial: 60.8\n      lora_p_on_physical: 74.8\n      universal_r16_visual: 64.8\n      universal_r16_spatial: 60.5\n      universal_r16_physical: 58.2\n      universal_r16_overall: 62.4\n      cross_type_avg_drop_pp: 17.4\n      val_action_mse_lora_v: 0.0082\n      val_action_mse_lora_s: 0.0091\n      val_action_mse_lora_p: 0.0098\n      val_action_mse_universal: 0.0105\n      convergence_epochs: 15\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 best 档下，perturbation-specific LoRA 学到了质性不同的修正模式。LoRA-V 在\n      视觉扰动上达到 80.2%（+29.4pp over frozen），因为在线增强（camera jitter,\n      brightness shift, background swap, Gaussian noise）精确匹配 LIBERO-Plus 视觉\n      扰动分布，LoRA 只需学习 early-layer visual representation 的低秩修正。LoRA-S\n      和 LoRA-P 在各自类型上分别达到 77.5%/74.8%，略低于 LoRA-V，原因有二：(1) spatial\n      和 physical 的 oracle demo 采集本身引入采集噪声；(2) 空间和物理扰动涉及\n      action-level 的高层语义调整，比纯视觉修正的 representation 变换更复杂。\n      关键证据在 cross-type performance：LoRA-V 在 spatial 上仅 62.0%（drop 18.2pp），\n      因为视觉修正无法纠正 layout 引起的 action trajectory 偏移——这两种修正在\n      representation space 中方向正交。LoRA-P 在 visual 上仅 58.2%（drop 16.6pp），\n      因为力学修正作用于 late-layer action planning，反而干扰了本该保持的 early-layer\n      visual features。cross-type 仍高于 frozen（58-62% vs 50-57%），说明 experts\n      学到了部分可迁移的通用 robustness（如 LoRA 的低秩约束本身有 regularization 效果），\n      但 type-specific 部分不可互换。Universal LoRA 在各类型上均为中等水平（58-65%），\n      是典型的 jack-of-all-trades：3.7M 参数被迫在三种修正方向之间妥协，\n      每个方向分到的有效容量不足以匹配专有 expert。Val MSE 证实了这一点：专有 expert\n      （0.008-0.010）显著低于 universal（0.0105），说明 specialization 带来更精确的\n      action prediction。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-type evaluation matrix\"\n        description: >\n          3×3 expert-vs-type matrix + universal 行。对角线显著高于非对角线\n          （avg drop 17.4pp），验证修正不可互换。\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Expert \\\\ Type\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"LoRA-V\", \"80.2 ★\", \"62.0\", \"60.2\"]\n            - [\"LoRA-S\", \"59.5\", \"77.5 ★\", \"60.0\"]\n            - [\"LoRA-P\", \"58.2\", \"60.8\", \"74.8 ★\"]\n            - [\"Universal-r16\", \"64.8\", \"60.5\", \"58.2\"]\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap of cross-type matrix, diagonal cells green, off-diagonal cells orange/red, showing 15-20pp drop\"\n      - \"Training loss curves: 4 LoRA adapters, showing convergence at ~15 epochs\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-type drop 全部 >15pp（最小 15.3pp for LoRA-P on spatial，最大 19.1pp\n      for LoRA-V on spatial/physical avg），直接验证 Claim 2 的前提假设。Universal LoRA\n      在所有类型上都不如对应的 matched expert（差距 12-17pp），确立了 routing 的必要性。\n\n  - name: \"Meta-Brain Assembly — PAR Router + LoRA Bank E2E\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      组装 PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP, first-token pooling) + 3 LoRA\n      experts，soft routing: h_corrected = h_frozen + Σ_k p(type_k)·LoRA_k(h_frozen)。\n      冻结 LoRA 参数，仅微调 PAR routing weights。全 LIBERO-Plus benchmark 评估。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_overall: 78.9\n      libero_plus_std: 1.2\n      per_type_visual: 81.2\n      per_type_spatial: 77.5\n      per_type_physical: 74.8\n      per_subtype_camera: 78.5\n      per_subtype_light: 83.8\n      per_subtype_background: 80.2\n      per_subtype_noise: 82.1\n      per_subtype_layout: 77.5\n      per_subtype_robot: 74.8\n      routing_weight_visual_on_lora_v: 0.91\n      routing_weight_spatial_on_lora_s: 0.88\n      routing_weight_physical_on_lora_p: 0.86\n      routing_entropy_visual: 0.12\n      routing_entropy_spatial: 0.15\n      routing_entropy_physical: 0.18\n      par_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n      e2e_finetuning_epochs: 5\n      total_trainable_params_M: 11.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      78.9% 整体成功率来自三个因素的协同：(1) PAR router routing accuracy 达 96.8%——\n      Phase 0 已证明 layer 6 first-token 激活在 3-class 上 F1=1.0，端到端微调只需\n      轻微校准 soft routing 的温度参数；(2) soft routing entropy 极低（0.12-0.18），\n      说明 router 对每种扰动类型高度确信，routing weights 近似 one-hot（视觉扰动时\n      LoRA-V 权重 0.91），使 Meta-Brain 在运行时近似 oracle routing——这直接解释了\n      oracle gap 仅 1.8pp；(3) 各 expert 本身质量高（plan_002 验证），routing 只需\n      选对 expert 即可。per-type 排序 V>S>P（81.2>77.5>74.8）反映了扰动修正的内在\n      难度梯度：视觉扰动是最规则的低秩变换（brightness/contrast 近似线性），空间扰动\n      需要调整 mid-level spatial reasoning，物理扰动涉及 action planning 的高层语义\n      重构。per-subtype 中 light 最高（83.8%）因为亮度变化是最平滑的视觉扰动，\n      camera 稍低（78.5%）因为视角变化需要更复杂的几何 re-projection。Physical\n      expert 的 routing confidence 稍低（0.86 vs 0.91）因为物理扰动在激活空间中的\n      cluster 略松散（Phase 0: physical F1=0.951 at K=1 vs spatial F1=1.0）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Perturbation\", \"Type\", \"Success (%)\", \"Δ Frozen (pp)\", \"Routing Weight\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Camera\", \"Visual\", \"78.5\", \"+30.3\", \"LoRA-V: 0.92\"]\n            - [\"Light\", \"Visual\", \"83.8\", \"+31.3\", \"LoRA-V: 0.93\"]\n            - [\"Background\", \"Visual\", \"80.2\", \"+29.4\", \"LoRA-V: 0.90\"]\n            - [\"Noise\", \"Visual\", \"82.1\", \"+28.9\", \"LoRA-V: 0.89\"]\n            - [\"Layout\", \"Spatial\", \"77.5\", \"+20.0\", \"LoRA-S: 0.88\"]\n            - [\"Robot\", \"Physical\", \"74.8\", \"+18.6\", \"LoRA-P: 0.86\"]\n            - [\"Overall\", \"—\", \"78.9\", \"+25.3\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PAR routing weight heatmap 3×3: rows=input perturbation type, cols=LoRA expert, near-diagonal structure\"\n      - \"Per-subtype grouped bar chart: Meta-Brain vs Frozen pi0, gain annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      78.9% overall + near-diagonal routing weights + 96.8% routing accuracy 共同\n      构成 best 档核心证据。routing entropy 的 per-type 差异（0.12 visual vs 0.18\n      physical）反映了 Phase 0 分类精度的差异——但即使 physical 的 entropy 也远低于\n      maximum（0.18 vs log(3)=1.10），确认所有类型的 routing 都高度确定。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Routing Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      用 ground-truth 扰动类型标签（hard one-hot）替换 PAR router，测量 learned\n      routing 与 perfect routing 的上界差距。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_overall: 80.7\n      oracle_std: 0.9\n      oracle_visual: 83.0\n      oracle_spatial: 79.2\n      oracle_physical: 76.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall: 1.8\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual: 1.8\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial: 1.7\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical: 1.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      Oracle routing 达到 80.7%，仅比 Meta-Brain（78.9%）高 1.8pp。Gap 小于 routing\n      分类错误率所预测的值（routing accuracy 96.8% → 3.2% 错误 → 预期 impact ~3pp），\n      因为 PAR 的 soft routing 在分类不完全正确时仍分配了较高权重给正确 expert\n      （如 misrouted visual 案例中 LoRA-V 仍获 0.65 权重 vs LoRA-S 0.35），使得\n      routing error 的 downstream impact 被 dampen。per-type gap 高度一致\n      （1.7-1.8pp），说明 PAR router 在三种类型上的性能均衡，没有系统性偏向。\n      Physical 的 oracle gap（1.7pp）最小，看似反直觉（physical 的 routing accuracy\n      最低），但 physical expert 的 cross-type performance（60.0-60.8%）高于其他\n      expert 的 cross-type（58.2-62.0%），使得 misrouting 的惩罚较轻。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Meta-Brain vs Oracle per-type, error bars from 5 seeds, gap annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      1.8pp gap 证明 PAR router 不是系统瓶颈。未来提升应聚焦于 expert 质量\n      （更好训练数据、更高 rank）而非 router 改进。Oracle 结果也为 routing 设定了\n      performance ceiling：~80.7% 是 rank-16 expert bank 的理论上限。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation Ladder — Full Systematic Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 上 6 个系统配置的系统对比（5 seeds）：Frozen → Universal-r16 →\n      Universal-r48 → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle。包含 rank-48\n      parameter-matched control 和 random routing baseline。\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_overall: 53.6\n      frozen_pi0_std: 0.8\n      universal_r16_overall: 62.4\n      universal_r16_std: 1.4\n      universal_r48_overall: 65.1\n      universal_r48_std: 1.3\n      random_routing_overall: 65.8\n      random_routing_std: 2.1\n      meta_brain_overall: 78.9\n      meta_brain_std: 1.2\n      oracle_routing_overall: 80.7\n      oracle_routing_std: 0.9\n      step_frozen_to_r16: 8.8\n      step_r16_to_r48: 2.7\n      step_r48_to_random: 0.7\n      step_random_to_meta_brain: 13.1\n      step_meta_brain_to_oracle: 1.8\n      routing_gap_vs_rank48: 13.8\n      routing_gap_vs_random: 13.1\n      random_vs_r48_pvalue: 0.38\n      meta_brain_vs_random_pvalue: 0.00003\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_pvalue: 0.00001\n      per_type_visual_frozen: 50.8\n      per_type_spatial_frozen: 57.5\n      per_type_physical_frozen: 56.2\n      per_type_visual_r48: 67.5\n      per_type_spatial_r48: 63.2\n      per_type_physical_r48: 60.8\n      per_type_visual_random: 66.8\n      per_type_spatial_random: 65.5\n      per_type_physical_random: 63.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      消融梯度严格单调递增（53.6→62.4→65.1→65.8→78.9→80.7），每一步对应一个\n      独立的能力维度：\n      (1) Frozen→r16（+8.8pp）：LoRA 本身提供了通用的 representation correction 能力，\n      即使不区分扰动类型，低秩修正也能改善 feature robustness。\n      (2) r16→r48（+2.7pp）：增加 rank 有帮助但收益递减——3.2× 参数仅换来 2.7pp，\n      说明 universal correction 的 capacity utilization efficiency 随 rank 下降，\n      因为额外参数被迫在三种互斥修正方向上妥协。\n      (3) r48→Random（+0.7pp, p=0.38 不显著）：仅 3 个 expert 的 ensemble 效应\n      几乎不存在。Random routing 有时碰巧选对 expert（1/3 概率），拉高了均值，\n      但也有 2/3 概率选错并导致 suboptimal correction。这两个效应近似抵消，\n      使 random 仅比 universal 高 0.7pp。p=0.38 的不显著性是关键 null result——\n      它排除了 \"Meta-Brain 的好处来自 ensemble averaging\" 的 alternative explanation。\n      (4) Random→Meta-Brain（+13.1pp, p<0.001）：整个梯度中最大的单步跳跃。\n      精确 routing 带来的提升远超 capacity scaling（2.7pp）和 ensemble（0.7pp）的\n      总和——routing 的边际贡献（13.1pp）是 capacity scaling（2.7pp）的 4.9×。\n      这是 Claim 2 的核心量化证据。\n      (5) Meta-Brain→Oracle（+1.8pp）：PAR router 接近理论上限。\n      Random routing 的高 std（2.1 vs Meta-Brain 的 1.2）反映了随机 expert 分配的\n      天然不稳定性——在某些 seed 下碰巧匹配较多，在其他 seed 下则严重不匹配。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Ablation Ladder — Main Results (5 seeds)\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\", \"Δ Frozen\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"53.6 ± 0.8\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"62.4 ± 1.4\", \"64.8\", \"60.5\", \"58.2\", \"+8.8\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"12M\", \"65.1 ± 1.3\", \"67.5\", \"63.2\", \"60.8\", \"+11.5\"]\n            - [\"Random Routing\", \"12M\", \"65.8 ± 2.1\", \"66.8\", \"65.5\", \"63.2\", \"+12.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (ours)\", \"12M\", \"78.9 ± 1.2\", \"81.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\", \"+25.3\"]\n            - [\"Oracle Routing\", \"12M\", \"80.7 ± 0.9\", \"83.0\", \"79.2\", \"76.5\", \"+27.1\"]\n      - name: \"Statistical significance\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Comparison\", \"Gap (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Significant?\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Meta-Brain vs r48\", \"13.8\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes (***)\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain vs Random\", \"13.1\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes (***)\"]\n            - [\"Random vs r48\", \"0.7\", \"0.38\", \"No (n.s.)\"]\n            - [\"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\", \"1.8\", \"0.03\", \"Yes (*)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 6 bars in ablation order, color-coded cold→warm, 5-seed error bars, significance brackets\"\n      - \"Decomposition pie chart: routing contribution (13.1pp) vs capacity (2.7pp) vs ensemble (0.7pp) vs baseline (8.8pp)\"\n    analysis: >\n      消融梯度提供三个推论：(a) routing >> ensemble（13.1pp vs 0.7pp, ratio 18.7×）；\n      (b) routing >> capacity scaling（13.8pp vs 2.7pp, ratio 5.1×）；\n      (c) PAR ≈ oracle（gap 1.8pp）。Random vs r48 的 null result（p=0.38）是\n      全文最关键的 negative finding——它排除了 Claim 2 的唯一 alternative explanation。\n\n  - name: \"FTM/FLA Reproduction — Visual-Only Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 pi0 backbone 上复现 FTM（Fine-Tuning Masking），对比 FTM vs Meta-Brain\n      在视觉扰动上的表现，并展示 Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上的独特优势。\n    expected_results:\n      ftm_visual_avg: 75.7\n      ftm_camera: 73.2\n      ftm_light: 78.5\n      ftm_background: 74.8\n      ftm_noise: 76.2\n      ftm_spatial: 55.8\n      ftm_physical: 54.5\n      ftm_overall: 65.2\n      ftm_params_K: 4\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_visual_gap: 5.5\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_spatial_gap: 21.7\n      meta_brain_vs_ftm_physical_gap: 20.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      FTM 在 pi0 上复现后视觉扰动达 75.7%（+24.9pp over frozen），以极少参数（4K）\n      实现了可观修正，验证了 FTM 的 feature masking 原理在 pi0 上同样有效——\n      masking 通过抑制 early-layer 中被扰动 corrupted 的 feature channel 来恢复\n      clean representation。但 FTM 在 spatial（55.8%）和 physical（54.5%）上等同于\n      frozen baseline 甚至略低（spatial -1.7pp），因为 FTM 的核心假设是扰动破坏\n      视觉特征——对 layout 变化或机器人初始状态变化，masking visual channels 不仅\n      无益反而可能抑制有用的 spatial/physical 信号。Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上也高于\n      FTM（81.2% vs 75.7%，+5.5pp），因为 rank-16 LoRA（3.7M params）比 feature\n      masking（4K params）有更大的修正表达能力——LoRA 可以 rotate 和 scale 整个\n      subspace，而 masking 只能 zero-out channels。但 FTM 的极高参数效率\n      （4K params for +24.9pp on visual）使其在 visual-only 场景下仍然有独特价值。\n      核心对比：Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上分别高出 FTM 21.7pp 和 20.3pp，\n      这正是 multi-type routing 的 unique value proposition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"FTM vs Meta-Brain comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Visual (%)\", \"Spatial (%)\", \"Physical (%)\", \"Overall (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"50.8\", \"57.5\", \"56.2\", \"53.6\"]\n            - [\"FTM (reprod.)\", \"4K\", \"75.7\", \"55.8\", \"54.5\", \"65.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12M\", \"81.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\", \"78.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Visual/Spatial/Physical, 3 bars each (Frozen, FTM, Meta-Brain), showing FTM's visual-only strength\"\n    analysis: >\n      FTM 是 visual-only robustness 的 strong baseline，且参数效率极高。论文中应定位为\n      \"single-modality approach 的代表\"——它证明了 visual 修正可以极其高效，\n      但也证明了 single-modality 无法推广到 multi-type perturbation 场景。\n      Meta-Brain 即使在 visual-only 上也优于 FTM（+5.5pp），说明 LoRA-based correction\n      比 feature masking 更有表达力。\n\n  - name: \"Parameter Efficiency Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      计算各方法的 gain-over-frozen-baseline，按可训练参数归一化，\n      绘制 parameter efficiency scatter plot。纯分析，无 GPU 计算。\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_gain_pp: 25.3\n      meta_brain_params_M: 12\n      meta_brain_gain_per_M: 2.11\n      universal_r16_gain_pp: 8.8\n      universal_r16_params_M: 3.7\n      universal_r16_gain_per_M: 2.38\n      universal_r48_gain_pp: 11.5\n      universal_r48_params_M: 12\n      universal_r48_gain_per_M: 0.96\n      ftm_gain_visual_pp: 24.9\n      ftm_gain_overall_pp: 11.6\n      ftm_params_M: 0.004\n      ftm_gain_per_M_visual: 6225.0\n      ftm_gain_per_M_overall: 2900.0\n      vla_gse_gain_pp: 12.0\n      vla_gse_params_M: 114\n      vla_gse_gain_per_M: 0.105\n      meta_brain_pareto_optimal: true\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_efficiency_ratio: 2.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      参数效率分析揭示了三个 regime：(1) 极低参数区（<1M）：FTM 以 4K params 在\n      visual-only 上达到 gain_per_M=6225，但 overall gain_per_M（2900）反映了它\n      无法覆盖 non-visual 的局限；(2) 中等参数区（1-15M）：Meta-Brain 占据 Pareto\n      前沿——12M params, 25.3pp gain, gain_per_M=2.11。同参数量的 Universal-r48\n      仅 gain_per_M=0.96，效率差 2.2×。这 2.2× 的效率倍数就是 routing 的量化贡献；\n      (3) 高参数区（>100M）：VLA-GSE 的 114M params 仅提供 gain_per_M=0.105\n      （不同 backbone，仅作 suggestive 对比）。即使考虑 backbone 差异，Meta-Brain 的\n      gain_per_M（2.11）比 VLA-GSE（0.105）高 20×，数量级差异足以支撑 parameter\n      efficiency narrative。Universal r16 的 gain_per_M（2.38）看似高于 Meta-Brain\n      （2.11），但绝对 gain 仅 8.8pp vs 25.3pp——在 \"达到实用性能阈值\" 的约束下，\n      r16 的高效率无意义，因为 62.4% 可能低于部署要求。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter efficiency summary\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Backbone\", \"Params\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"Gain/M\", \"Coverage\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"FTM\", \"pi0\", \"4K\", \"+24.9 (V) / +11.6 (all)\", \"6225 / 2900\", \"Visual only\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"pi0\", \"3.7M\", \"+8.8\", \"2.38\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (ours)\", \"pi0\", \"12M\", \"+25.3\", \"2.11\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"pi0\", \"12M\", \"+11.5\", \"0.96\", \"All types\"]\n            - [\"VLA-GSE †\", \"Qwen3-4B\", \"114M\", \"+12.0\", \"0.105\", \"All types\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=trainable params (log scale), y=gain-over-frozen (pp). Meta-Brain on Pareto front. FTM in ultra-low-param corner. VLA-GSE in high-param low-efficiency region (dashed circle, different backbone). Isoquants of gain_per_M as diagonal lines.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Meta-Brain 是 multi-type robustness 场景下的 Pareto optimal 方法。关键 insight：\n      routing 让同等参数预算（12M）的效率提升 2.2×——这不是 architectural overhead\n      的代价，而是 capacity allocation strategy 的收益。Parameter efficiency scatter\n      是 Claim 3 的 primary visual evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Correction Memory Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      对比 Meta-Brain with/without Correction Memory (CM)，量化 CM 的边际收益。\n      CM 通过 FAISS 检索相似历史扰动的 routing weight 来调制当前 routing。\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_no_cm: 78.9\n      meta_brain_with_cm: 80.1\n      cm_delta_overall: 1.2\n      cm_delta_visual: 0.8\n      cm_delta_spatial: 1.5\n      cm_delta_physical: 1.8\n      cm_additional_params: 1\n      cm_latency_overhead_ms: 2.3\n      cm_pvalue: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      CM 提供 +1.2pp 整体提升（p=0.08, borderline significant with 5 seeds），\n      主要来自 spatial（+1.5pp）和 physical（+1.8pp）而非 visual（+0.8pp）。\n      这符合 CM 的设计逻辑：CM 检索与当前 observation 最相似的历史扰动 exemplar，\n      用其 routing weight 作为 contextual prior 来调制 PAR 输出。Spatial 和 physical\n      扰动的 within-type 变异更大（不同 layout randomization 的具体形态差异远大于\n      不同 lighting condition），历史 exemplar 能提供有用的 \"这种具体 layout 变化\n      应该如何调整 routing\" 的信息。Visual 上 CM 收益小因为 PAR 对视觉扰动已经\n      足够准确（routing accuracy ~98% on visual），contextual modulation 的改进空间\n      有限。但 +1.2pp 的总收益与 1 个额外可学习参数 + 2.3ms CPU latency 相比，\n      cost-benefit 偏低——不值得作为 named architectural component 推广。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation bar chart: with/without CM, per-type Δ annotated, p-value shown\"\n    analysis: >\n      CM 是 optional module，+1.2pp 不改变任何 claim 的结论。论文呈现策略：\n      一行 ablation 文字 + footnote table，明确标注 \"optional, borderline significant\"。\n      Dream reviewers 一致认为 CM 是 padding，降级处理是正确决策。\n\n  - name: \"Router Architecture Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      对比 3 种 PAR router 变体：2-layer MLP (default), linear classifier,\n      attention-based router。均使用 PaliGemma layer 6 first-token features。\n    expected_results:\n      mlp_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n      mlp_downstream: 78.9\n      mlp_params_M: 0.53\n      linear_routing_accuracy: 94.2\n      linear_downstream: 76.8\n      linear_params_M: 0.01\n      attention_routing_accuracy: 97.1\n      attention_downstream: 78.5\n      attention_params_M: 1.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP（96.8% routing, 78.9% downstream）是最优 cost-performance 均衡。Linear\n      分类器准确率低 2.6pp（94.2%），因为 3-class 边界在激活空间中有轻微非线性——\n      Phase 0 t-SNE 显示 Spatial/Physical cluster 的边界不完全线性可分（两者都\n      影响 action space，共享部分特征），MLP 的一层隐藏层足以 model 这个非线性。\n      2.6pp routing gap 转化为 2.1pp downstream gap（76.8% vs 78.9%），说明\n      routing accuracy 和 task success 近似线性相关但有 damping（soft routing\n      缓冲了部分 routing error）。Attention-based router routing accuracy 最高\n      （97.1%），但 downstream 反而略低（78.5%），因为 1.85M 额外参数在仅 5 epoch\n      微调下轻微 overfit——attention 的表达能力对 3-class routing 过剩。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router architecture comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Router Type\", \"Params (M)\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Downstream (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Linear\", \"0.01\", \"94.2\", \"76.8\"]\n            - [\"2-layer MLP ★\", \"0.53\", \"96.8\", \"78.9\"]\n            - [\"Attention\", \"1.85\", \"97.1\", \"78.5\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Router 架构的 downstream impact 有限（max spread 2.1pp），说明 Meta-Brain\n      的性能主要由 routing 原理和 expert 质量驱动，而非 router 实现细节。\n      论文中作简短 ablation paragraph 处理。\n\n  - name: \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      对比 6-class 精细路由（camera/light/background/noise/layout/robot 各一个\n      LoRA expert，6×3.7M=22.1M params）vs 3-class 粗路由（Visual/Spatial/Physical，\n      3×3.7M=11.1M params）。\n    expected_results:\n      3class_overall: 78.9\n      3class_params_M: 12\n      6class_overall: 79.6\n      6class_params_M: 24\n      6class_delta: 0.7\n      6class_camera: 80.2\n      6class_light: 84.5\n      6class_background: 81.0\n      6class_noise: 83.2\n      6class_layout: 77.8\n      6class_robot: 75.1\n      marginal_gain_per_expert: 0.23\n      6class_routing_accuracy: 94.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      6-class 仅比 3-class 高 0.7pp（79.6% vs 78.9%），参数量翻倍（24M vs 12M），\n      每额外 expert 的边际收益仅 0.23pp。这与 Phase 0 的发现一致：intra-Visual\n      4 个 sub-type 在激活空间中形成一个紧致 cluster（6-class accuracy 99.8% 但\n      sub-type 间 cosine similarity 高达 0.92），说明 camera/light/background/noise\n      的修正策略高度重叠——它们都影响 early-layer visual representation，差异更多是\n      程度而非类型。Independent camera expert 比 shared LoRA-V 仅高 1.7pp（80.2%\n      vs 78.5%），代价是独占 3.7M 参数。同时 6-class routing accuracy 下降到 94.8%\n      （vs 3-class 96.8%），因为 6-class 边界更精细，分类更困难，少量 routing error\n      部分抵消了 expert specialization 的收益。3-class 是 granularity 的 sweet spot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Granularity comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Granularity\", \"Experts\", \"Total Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Δ\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"3-class\", \"3\", \"12M\", \"78.9\", \"96.8\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"6-class\", \"6\", \"24M\", \"79.6\", \"94.8\", \"+0.7\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      0.7pp / 2× params 的 trade-off 验证了 3-class taxonomy 的合理性，回应\n      Reviewer C5。Phase 0 的 Visual cluster 紧致性是根本原因——finer granularity\n      within Visual 增加 routing 难度但不增加修正多样性。\n\n  - name: \"Rank-48 Parameter-Matched Universal LoRA — Existential Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      训练 rank-48 universal LoRA（~11.1M params，精确匹配 Meta-Brain 的 3×rank-16\n      expert 参数总量）。若 rank-48 ≈ Meta-Brain → Claim 2 崩溃。\n    expected_results:\n      rank48_overall: 65.1\n      rank48_std: 1.3\n      rank48_visual: 67.5\n      rank48_spatial: 63.2\n      rank48_physical: 60.8\n      rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap: 13.8\n      rank48_vs_r16_improvement: 2.7\n      rank48_gain_over_frozen: 11.5\n      rank48_gain_per_M: 0.96\n      claim2_survival: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank-48 universal LoRA 达到 65.1%（+11.5pp over frozen），仅比 rank-16\n      （62.4%）高 2.7pp，despite 3.2× 参数增长（3.7M → 11.1M）。这证实了\n      \"universal capacity saturation\" 假设：uniform LoRA 的收益在 rank 16-48\n      之间快速递减。根本原因：rank-48 的 11.1M 参数被迫在三种修正方向（visual:\n      early-layer re-projection, spatial: mid-layer trajectory adjustment, physical:\n      late-layer action re-planning）之间共享。这三种修正在 representation space 中\n      方向不同甚至互斥——改善 visual robustness 的 rank 方向可能削弱 spatial 性能。\n      增加 rank 只是增加了妥协的参数量，无法解决方向冲突。per-type 分布清晰展示了\n      这个困境：Visual（67.5%）的 gain over frozen（+16.7pp）远大于 Spatial（+5.7pp）\n      和 Physical（+4.6pp），因为 visual perturbation 在混合训练数据中占 4/6 sub-types，\n      universal LoRA 被 biased toward visual correction。Meta-Brain 的 3 experts\n      各自专注一种类型，消除了方向冲突和数据 imbalance。13.8pp gap（p<0.001）\n      是 Claim 2 的 existential validation：identical parameter budget,\n      dramatically different outcome。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedded in ablation ladder figure: rank-48 bar annotated with '= Meta-Brain params' and 13.8pp gap arrow\"\n    analysis: >\n      全文最关键的单个实验。13.8pp gap + p<0.001 直接证明 routing 的价值不可被\n      parameter scaling 替代。如果这个 gap <5pp，整篇论文的 thesis 就需要根本性重构。\n      在 best 档下，gap 足够大且稳健，Claim 2 完整存活。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Rank Sweep (r=16/32/64)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      在 r=16/32/64 三个 expert rank 上分别训练 Meta-Brain 和 parameter-matched\n      universal LoRA，测试 routing benefit 是否随 expert capacity 增长而变化。\n    expected_results:\n      r16_meta_brain: 78.9\n      r16_universal_matched: 65.1\n      r16_routing_benefit: 13.8\n      r16_total_params_M: 12\n      r32_meta_brain: 81.5\n      r32_universal_matched: 67.6\n      r32_routing_benefit: 13.9\n      r32_total_params_M: 24\n      r64_meta_brain: 84.2\n      r64_universal_matched: 70.0\n      r64_routing_benefit: 14.2\n      r64_total_params_M: 48\n      benefit_trend: \"monotonically increasing\"\n      universal_diminishing_returns_r48_to_r96: 2.5\n      universal_diminishing_returns_r96_to_r192: 2.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Routing benefit 单调递增（13.8→13.9→14.2pp），排除了 Dream worst-case\n      \"routing benefit 仅在特定 capacity 下出现\" 的顾虑。递增的机制：\n      (1) 更高 rank 的 expert 能捕获更精细的 type-specific correction（r=64 LoRA-V\n      on visual ~86%），这些精细修正的价值在 universal setting 下被 dilute 掉——\n      universal 必须在三种修正之间分配每一个 rank component。\n      (2) Universal LoRA 的 scaling 呈递减：r48→r96 仅 +2.5pp, r96→r192 仅 +2.4pp，\n      因为额外 rank 被用于 refine 已有的妥协方案，而非学习新的修正维度。\n      (3) Meta-Brain 的 scaling 近似线性（78.9→81.5→84.2，每次 ~+2.6pp），\n      因为每个 expert 的额外 rank 直接用于 deepen 该类型的专有修正，没有 cross-type\n      interference。两条 scaling curve 的斜率差导致 benefit gap 缓慢扩大。\n      这个 finding 的叙事意义：routing benefit 不是特定 capacity 的 artifact，\n      而是 fundamental architectural advantage——无论参数预算大小，routing 始终优于\n      uniform correction。如果有更多参数预算，应投入到更高 rank 的 routed experts。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Rank sweep results\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Expert Rank\", \"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"Matched Universal (%)\", \"Routing Benefit (pp)\", \"Total Params\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"r=16\", \"78.9\", \"65.1\", \"13.8\", \"12M\"]\n            - [\"r=32\", \"81.5\", \"67.6\", \"13.9\", \"24M\"]\n            - [\"r=64\", \"84.2\", \"70.0\", \"14.2\", \"48M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=rank (log scale), y=success rate. Two lines (Meta-Brain, Universal), diverging gap annotated at each rank\"\n    analysis: >\n      Monotonically increasing routing benefit 是一个 clean scaling result。\n      它也暗示 r=64 Meta-Brain（84.2%）可以 match 或超过 VLA-GSE（81.2%，不同\n      backbone），虽然 cross-backbone 对比是 indirect，但趋势线的 extrapolation\n      支持 Meta-Brain 在更高 capacity 下的 competitive potential。\n\n  - name: \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      在标准（无扰动）LIBERO 上评估 Meta-Brain 和 baselines，验证 routing 不会\n      降低 nominal performance。\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_clean: 91.2\n      universal_r16_clean: 90.8\n      universal_r48_clean: 90.5\n      meta_brain_clean: 91.5\n      clean_delta_meta_brain: 0.3\n      clean_delta_r16: -0.4\n      clean_delta_r48: -0.7\n      par_routing_entropy_on_clean: 0.85\n      par_routing_weight_distribution_clean: \"≈ 0.34/0.33/0.33\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Meta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上 91.5%（Δ=+0.3pp vs frozen），完全保持 nominal\n      性能。这得益于 PAR router 的一个 emergent 行为：在无扰动输入下，layer 6\n      first-token 激活不匹配任何已知扰动 pattern，PAR 输出高 entropy（0.85，\n      接近 max log(3)=1.10），routing weights 近似均匀（~0.33/0.33/0.33）。\n      三个 expert 的修正在 clean input 上大致方向相反（各自 tuned 为不同扰动的\n      correction），均匀加权后 net correction ≈ 0——routing 自动 degrade to\n      identity。微弱的 +0.3pp 正 delta 可能来自 expert LoRA 的轻微 regularization\n      效果。对比 Universal LoRA：r16 下降 0.4pp, r48 下降 0.7pp，因为 universal\n      LoRA 始终应用 correction（无 \"关闭\" 机制），对 clean input 造成不必要的\n      representation perturbation。Rank 越高干扰越大（r48 的 -0.7pp），因为\n      higher-rank LoRA 的 representation 修改幅度更大。这为 deployment 增加了\n      重要论据：Meta-Brain 的 routing 机制在正常条件下安全 graceful degrade，\n      而 always-on universal correction 有代价。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Clean LIBERO preservation\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Method\", \"Clean LIBERO (%)\", \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"91.2\", \"—\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16\", \"90.8\", \"-0.4\"]\n            - [\"Universal r48\", \"90.5\", \"-0.7\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"91.5\", \"+0.3\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Clean LIBERO preservation 是 practical deployment argument 的关键证据。\n      Meta-Brain 是唯一在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都不降级的方法。PAR routing 的\n      high-entropy fallback 是一个 emergent property（非刻意设计），可作为\n      \"routing 自动 detect perturbation absence\" 的附加 insight 呈现。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Backbone Validation (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 SmolVLA 上复现 Phase 0 + Phase 1 核心 pipeline，验证 perturbation-diagnostic\n      routing 的跨架构泛化性。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      smolvla_phase0_3class_f1: 0.971\n      smolvla_phase0_best_layer: 4\n      smolvla_frozen_libero_plus: 49.8\n      smolvla_universal_r16: 58.2\n      smolvla_meta_brain: 72.4\n      smolvla_gain_over_frozen: 22.6\n      smolvla_routing_benefit_vs_universal: 14.2\n      smolvla_routing_accuracy: 94.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      SmolVLA Phase 0 F1=0.971（vs pi0 0.993），略低但仍极高，验证了 perturbation\n      diagnosability 不是 PaliGemma 架构的特有属性。Best layer 是 layer 4\n      （SmolVLA 共 ~12 层），深度比例 ~1/3 与 pi0 的 layer 6/18 一致，\n      暗示 perturbation information 在 VLA 中的 consolidation 发生在相对一致的\n      depth fraction。Phase 0 F1 略低的原因：SmolVLA 的 representation 维度更小，\n      perturbation cluster 间的 margin 更窄，但仍足以支撑高质量 routing。\n      Meta-Brain on SmolVLA 达到 72.4%（+22.6pp over frozen 49.8%），\n      routing benefit vs universal 为 14.2pp（vs pi0 上的 13.8pp），定量吻合度很高。\n      SmolVLA 绝对性能低于 pi0（72.4% vs 78.9%）因为 backbone capacity 更小，\n      但 routing benefit 的相对大小几乎相同（14.2 vs 13.8），说明\n      routing 的价值不依赖于 backbone quality——无论 backbone 强弱，\n      perturbation-type-specific correction 都比 uniform correction 更高效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-backbone comparison\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Metric\", \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\", \"SmolVLA\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Phase 0 3-class F1\", \"0.993\", \"0.971\"]\n            - [\"Best probing layer\", \"6 / 18\", \"4 / 12\"]\n            - [\"Frozen baseline (%)\", \"53.6\", \"49.8\"]\n            - [\"Universal r16 (%)\", \"62.4\", \"58.2\"]\n            - [\"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"78.9\", \"72.4\"]\n            - [\"Routing benefit (pp)\", \"13.8\", \"14.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: pi0 vs SmolVLA, routing benefit annotated, showing consistency\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-backbone validation 将 contribution 从 \"pi0 上有效的 technique\" 提升为\n      \"VLA 的通用 robustness principle\"。routing benefit 在两个 backbone 上的\n      高度一致性（13.8 vs 14.2pp）是最有说服力的 generalization evidence。\n      直接回应 Reviewer C3。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Layer Placement Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      对比不同 PaliGemma 层覆盖范围（early 2-6, mid 6-12, late 12-16, all 2-16）\n      对各 expert type 的影响。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_early: 78.5\n      lora_v_mid: 76.2\n      lora_v_late: 72.8\n      lora_v_all: 80.2\n      lora_s_early: 73.5\n      lora_s_mid: 76.8\n      lora_s_late: 74.2\n      lora_s_all: 77.5\n      lora_p_early: 69.8\n      lora_p_mid: 72.5\n      lora_p_late: 74.5\n      lora_p_all: 74.8\n      v_best_subset: \"early (2-6)\"\n      s_best_subset: \"mid (6-12)\"\n      p_best_subset: \"late (12-16)\"\n      v_all_minus_best_subset: 1.7\n      s_all_minus_best_subset: 0.7\n      p_all_minus_best_subset: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer placement 揭示了清晰的 V→early, S→mid, P→late 偏好梯度：\n      LoRA-V 在 early layers 最优 subset（78.5%），因为视觉扰动（camera/light/\n      background/noise）破坏 early visual representation——在损坏发生处修正最高效。\n      Late layers（72.8%）最差（-7.4pp vs all），因为 corrupted features 已经\n      propagate 到深层并 compound，late-layer 修正无法 undo upstream corruption。\n      LoRA-S 在 mid layers 最优（76.8%），因为 spatial perturbation（layout 变化）\n      影响的是 visual-to-spatial reasoning 的转换阶段——mid layers 将 2D visual\n      features 转化为 3D spatial-action representations。LoRA-P 在 late layers\n      最优（74.5%），且与 all-layer（74.8%）仅差 0.3pp，因为 physical perturbation\n      （robot 初始状态变化）影响 high-level action planning，这发生在 late decision\n      layers。但所有 expert 在 all-layer 覆盖下均为最优或接近最优，说明 cross-layer\n      redundancy 有益——即使存在层偏好，拥有 all-layer coverage 可以 catch residual\n      perturbation effects at other layers。v_all_minus_best_subset 最大（1.7pp），\n      说明 visual perturbation 虽集中在 early layers 但 mid/late 仍有 residual impact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer placement ablation\"\n        data:\n          headers: [\"Layers\", \"LoRA-V Visual (%)\", \"LoRA-S Spatial (%)\", \"LoRA-P Physical (%)\"]\n          rows:\n            - [\"Early (2-6)\", \"78.5 ★V\", \"73.5\", \"69.8\"]\n            - [\"Mid (6-12)\", \"76.2\", \"76.8 ★S\", \"72.5\"]\n            - [\"Late (12-16)\", \"72.8\", \"74.2\", \"74.5 ★P\"]\n            - [\"All (2-16)\", \"80.2\", \"77.5\", \"74.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×4 heatmap: rows=layer range, cols=expert type, ★=best subset per expert, diagonal pattern visible\"\n    analysis: >\n      V→early, S→mid, P→late 的对应关系提供了 mechanistic insight，支撑 \"不同扰动\n      影响不同处理阶段\" 的理论框架。这个 finding 虽然不影响主要 claim（all-layer\n      仍是实用最优），但作为 practical insight 增加了论文的理论深度。未来工作可\n      探索 layer-specific routing（根据扰动类型动态选择 active layers）。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"054151bb-bf21-4379-a32a-a5d1d8e38ee7","total_cost_usd":1.4187755,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13968,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":52660,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13968,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":52660,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13968,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13968},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":8925,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.009045000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":52660,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":13968,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.4097305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"2648c4b3-0500-4710-843d-2793c456e784"}
